<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 245-8 V AUSTRALIA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 245-8 V AUSTRALIA.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa scored 245 for</p>
<p>eight from their 50 overs in the third one day international</p>
<p>against Australia on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
